WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.100
Juri begins OD Shikusen from the forward jump.

2
00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:01.600
OD Shikusen connects with the grounded Ryu.

3
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:02.600
The heavy-kick follow-up extends the juggle.

4
00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:03.100
Raw Drive Rush closes the juggle distance.

5
00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:03.600
Back heavy kick connects from the Rush.

6
00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:04.600
The Rush cancel exhausts Juri’s remaining Drive and links crouching heavy.

7
00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:05.100
Go Ohsatsu continues the juggle without a Fuha stock.

8
00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:14.600
Normal-health Kaisen Dankairaku starts from the heavy special.

9
00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:15.000
Level 3 completes the full-Drive conversion.
